+++ b/contrib/chronik-parity/README.md
@@ -268,7 +268,9 @@ line by line.
   (`v2-branch`, one `taproot` alias, `v2-asset`), plus a `v2-all` set
   session, entries in the mixed session and payload-size error cases.
